{
  "name": "Grandfather's Clock",
  "description": "**Goal:** complete the clock. Each of its twelve foundations builds **up in suit** until its top card shows the hour it stands at: Jack for eleven, Queen for twelve, Ace for one.\n\n- The twelve starting cards are set out before the deal: 9♣ at twelve o'clock, then clockwise 10♥ J♠ Q♦ K♣ 2♥ 3♠ 4♦ 5♣ 6♥ 7♠ 8♦. Ranks wrap from King to Ace.\n- The other forty cards are dealt **face up** into eight columns of five, four each side of the clock.\n- Columns build **down regardless of suit**. Move one card at a time.\n- Any card may fill an empty column.",
  "rules": {
    "foundation": {
      "single": true,
      "seedNone": true,
      "build": { "direction": "Up", "wrap": true },
      "suit": "Same"
    },
    "tableau": { "build": { "direction": "Down" } }
  },
